---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Am Llansannan" title_en="About Llansannan">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1>Llansannan</h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo; Llansannan</div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content">
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Pentref Llansannan</span><span lang="en">The Village of Llansannan</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Llansannan yn bentref yng nghalon Bro Aled, ardal o fryniau a dyffrynnoedd hardd yng Nghonwy, gogledd Cymru. Mae'r pentref yn adnabyddus am ei gymeriad Cymraeg cryf a'i dreftadaeth hanesyddol gyfoethog.</p>
    <p lang="en">Llansannan is a village at the heart of Bro Aled, an area of beautiful hills and valleys in Conwy, north Wales. The village is known for its strong Welsh character and rich historical heritage.</p>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0">
      <a href="/llansannan/history/" class="qa-card">
        <div class="qa-label"><span lang="cy">Hanes</span><span lang="en">History</span></div>
        <div class="qa-desc"><span lang="cy">Cipolwg ar hanes yr ardal</span><span lang="en">A glimpse of local history</span></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/llansannan/az/" class="qa-card">
        <div class="qa-label">Llansannan A–Z</div>
        <div class="qa-desc"><span lang="cy">Cyfeiriadur lleol</span><span lang="en">Local directory</span></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/llansannan/business/" class="qa-card">
        <div class="qa-label"><span lang="cy">Busnesau &amp; Grwpiau</span><span lang="en">Businesses &amp; Groups</span></div>
        <div class="qa-desc"><span lang="cy">Busnesau a grwpiau cymunedol lleol</span><span lang="en">Local businesses and community groups</span></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/llansannan/gallery/" class="qa-card">
        <div class="qa-label"><span lang="cy">Oriel</span><span lang="en">Gallery</span></div>
        <div class="qa-desc"><span lang="cy">Lluniau o'r pentref a'r ardal</span><span lang="en">Photos of the village and area</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
